flowchart LR
    md[Markdown file] --> parse[Parse]
    parse --> text[Plain text blocks]
    parse --> rich[Mermaid, maths, headings, wide tables]
    rich --> render[Render to PNG]
    render --> upload[Upload once with kitty graphics]
    upload --> place[Unicode placeholders in the text flow]
    text --> screen[Terminal]
    place --> screen
